      "name": "dsh-icon-library",
      "title": {
        "en": "Icon Library",
        "zh": "Icon Library"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A workspace icon library for your project: drag icons into the chat as <name>, let the agent pick the right icon by meaning, and edit an SVG once to update every place it is used.",
        "zh": "项目自己的图标库：把图标拖进对话用 <图标名> 指代，让 Agent 按语义从库里挑选合适图标；改一次 SVG，代码里的所有引用一起更新。"
      },
      "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brickhu/dsh-plugins/main/icon-studio/icon.svg",
